    "note": "Mana reductions affect only the generic component, including announced X and equivalent costs; source actual artifact/token status and controller determine applicability. Total activation cost locks before mana abilities and stays fixed through subsequent source/provider changes. Creature counter removal is a non-targeting cost, limited to actual controlled creature incarnations and the specified counter kind; mana is generated before removing the selected counter. No extra tap or once-per-turn cost is invented for Ray Fillet. Corrected inherited fixed mana components from zero to GG against the pinned XGG Oracle cost; X remains separately announced."
